hich is a terminal node. Therefore, the player who moves to N4 wins immediately because the opponent has no move. Thus, moving to N4 is the only option and results in an immediate win. No other choice exists, so this is the optimal move.</reason>\n<answer>N4</answer>", "episode_score": 0.4931239388794567, "llm_raw_text": "<reason>From N5, the only legal move is to N4, which is a terminal node. Therefore, the player who moves to N4 wins immediately because the opponent has no move. Thus, moving to N4 is the only option and results in an immediate win. No other choice exists, so this is the optimal move.</reason>\n<answer>N4</answer>"}]
