[2026-08-12 16:20:43] [agentic_pipeline.py (513)] [INFO] [DRIVER 0 / 1][PID 508552] [{"prompt": "system\nYou are playing Directed Acyclic Graph Vertex Geography.user\nThe players alternate moving a token along one directed edge. A player with no legal move loses. Choose one legal destination that maximizes your final game outcome. Keep your thinking process concise.\n\nOutput exactly:\n<reason>your analysis</reason>\n<answer>NODE</answer>\n\nDo not output anything else. A response that does not follow this format results in immediate loss.\n\nCurrent node: N1\n\nDirected graph:\nN8 -> terminal\nN3 -> N6, N4\nN7 -> terminal\nN1 -> N0, N3\nN5 -> terminal\nN2 -> N0, N9\nN4 -> N8, N5\nN0 -> N7\nN6 -> N2, N5\nN9 -> terminal\n\nLegal moves: N0, N3assistant\n", "response": "<reason>From N1, the legal moves are to N0 and N3.  \n- Moving to N0 leads to N7 (terminal), so the opponent wins immediately.  \n- Moving to N3 leads to N6 or N4.  \n  - From N6: to N2 or N5 (N5 is terminal, N2 to N0 or N9; N0 to N7, N9 terminal).  \n  - From N4: to N8 or N5 (both terminal).  \nThus, moving to N3 gives the current player a winning strategy by forcing the opponent into a terminal node.  \nTherefore, choosing N3 maximizes the outcome.</reason>\n<answer>N3</answer>", "episode_score": 1.4328522920203735, "llm_raw_text": "<reason>From N1, the legal moves are to N0 and N3.  \n- Moving to N0 leads to N7 (terminal), so the opponent wins immediately.  \n- Moving to N3 leads to N6 or N4.  \n  - From N6: to N2 or N5 (N5 is terminal, N2 to N0 or N9; N0 to N7, N9 terminal).  \n  - From N4: to N8 or N5 (both terminal).  \nThus, moving to N3 gives the current player a winning strategy by forcing the opponent into a terminal node.  \nTherefore, choosing N3 maximizes the outcome.</reason>\n<answer>N3</answer>"}, {"prompt": "system\nYou are playing Directed Acyclic Graph Vertex Geography.user\nThe players alternate moving a token along one directed edge. A player with no legal move loses. Choose one leg