al\nN9 -> terminal\nN0 -> N2\nN6 -> N7, N8, N0\n\nLegal moves: N2assistant\n", "response": "<reason>From N0, the only legal move is to N2. From N2, the player can move to N3 or N4. N4 leads to terminal, so the opponent wins immediately. N3 leads to N1, which is terminal. Thus, moving to N3 results in the opponent having no move after that. Therefore, moving to N3 is a winning move. So, from N0, moving to N2 and then to N3 is optimal. The best first move is to N2.</reason>\n<answer>N2</answer>", "episode_score": 0.46001697792869267, "llm_raw_text": "<reason>From N0, the only legal move is to N2. From N2, the player can move to N3 or N4. N4 leads to terminal, so the opponent wins immediately. N3 leads to N1, which is terminal. Thus, moving to N3 results in the opponent having no move after that. Therefore, moving to N3 is a winning move. So, from N0, moving to N2 and then to N3 is optimal. The best first move is to N2.</reason>\n<answer>N2</answer>"}]
