nswer>", "episode_score": 1.4990662139219015, "llm_raw_text": "<reason>From N3, the legal moves are to N8 and N1. N8 leads directly to terminal, so the player who moves to N8 wins immediately (the opponent has no move). Thus, moving to N8 is a winning move. Therefore, the optimal choice is N8.</reason>\n<answer>N8</answer>"}]
