 0.4133276740237691, "llm_raw_text": "<reason>From N0, the legal moves are to N2 and N7.  \n- Moving to N2 leads to N3 or N11. N11 is terminal (win for the opponent if they move), so from N3, the opponent can go to N8 or N4. N4 is terminal, so from N8, they can go to N5 (terminal) or N13. N13 leads to N5 or N6 (both terminal). So from N3, the opponent can force a win.  \n- Moving to N7 leads to N9 or N6 (both terminal). So the opponent has no move after. Thus, moving to N7 results in an immediate win for the current player.  \nThus, choosing N7 is optimal.</reason>\n<answer>N7</answer>"}]
