ent player a winning strategy.  \nThus, choosing N7 maximizes the outcome.</reason>\n<answer>N7</answer>", "episode_score": 1.3912563667232598, "llm_raw_text": "<reason>From N4, the legal moves are to N7 and N3.  \n- Moving to N7 leads to N3 or N9.  \n  - From N3: to N0 (terminal) or N5.  \n    - N0 is terminal (win for opponent).  \n    - N5 → N8 or N6 (N6 is terminal, N8 → N6 or N2; both lead to terminal).  \n  - From N9: to N1 (terminal).  \n  So from N7, the opponent can be forced into a terminal node.  \n- Moving to N3 leads to N0 (terminal) or N5.  \n  - N0 is terminal.  \n  - N5 → N8 or N6 (both eventually terminal).  \nThus, moving to N7 gives the current player a winning strategy.  \nThus, choosing N7 maximizes the outcome.</reason>\n<answer>N7</answer>"}]
